    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637940/extras/ff2aadf3038a5ad0d6e4ded3bd32134e.avif?t=1750686315\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You (a cat) wake up inside a grassy ball with a gun. Onions start sprouting up from the ground and she has two choices: kill or be killed. Survive for 21 rounds to escape this grassy onion ridden hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy the onions with tons guns and explosives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power up with items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot and kill the onions to gain points</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop mystery gacha ball from the sky containing items and weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump on clouds to avoid the onions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637940/extras/a606cfdfd489bdc7c1214ff0068ed009.poster.avif?t=1750686315\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637940/extras/a606cfdfd489bdc7c1214ff0068ed009.webm?t=1750686315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637940/extras/a606cfdfd489bdc7c1214ff0068ed009.mp4?t=1750686315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637940/extras/ff2aadf3038a5ad0d6e4ded3bd32134e.avif?t=1750686315\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You (a cat) wake up inside a grassy ball with a gun. Onions start sprouting up from the ground and she has two choices: kill or be killed. Survive for 21 rounds to escape this grassy onion ridden hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy the onions with tons guns and explosives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power up with items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot and kill the onions to gain points</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop mystery gacha ball from the sky containing items and weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump on clouds to avoid the onions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637940/extras/a606cfdfd489bdc7c1214ff0068ed009.poster.avif?t=1750686315\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637940/extras/a606cfdfd489bdc7c1214ff0068ed009.webm?t=1750686315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637940/extras/a606cfdfd489bdc7c1214ff0068ed009.mp4?t=1750686315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
